      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-08-012\" hidden></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12340]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>FACTOR XI DEFICIENCY:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12341]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Autosomal disorder:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12342]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Recessive.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12343]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Dominant.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12344]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Non-Jewish</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> 1/1000,000.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12345]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Ashkenazi Je</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ws:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12346]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Homo</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>zygous </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>0.2</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> \u2013 0.5%.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12347]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Heterozygosity 8% - demonstrate bleeding tendency</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12348]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Helps in amplification of coagulation process</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> a</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>fter initial thrombin formation.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12349]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Plasma level \u2013 poor co relation with bleeding.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12350]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Spontaneous bleeding \u2013 rare.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12351]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Bleeding after trauma.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12352]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Heterozygote</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong> clinical type</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12353]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>XI, bleeding, tendency ev</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>en with m</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ild reduction.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12354]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>ANC:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12355]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Level Check:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12356]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Booking, 3</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>rd</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>, prior to invasive procedure.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12357]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Levels don\u2019t </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>rise</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> in pregnancy (usually).</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12358]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Assess all women for compounding Factors, VWF, Plt dysfunction.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12359]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>e</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>d Risk of Bleeding:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12360]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>O blood </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>gro</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>up, bleeding phenotype</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12361]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Other compounding factors like VWF, Plt dysfunction.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12362]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Neonatal Risks:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12363]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Minimal except homozygosity or compound heterozygote.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12364]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>No </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>I</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>CH, No</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> need for</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> PND.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12365]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><em><strong>Therapeutic Options:</strong></em></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12366]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><em><strong>Tranexamic Acid</strong></em></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12367]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><em><strong>Facto</strong></em></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><em><strong>r</strong></em></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><em><strong> XI concentrate</strong></em></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12368]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><em><strong>FFP </strong></em></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12369]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Tranexamic \u2013 never with factor XI concentrate =&gt; risk of thrombosis alone tranexamic acid is sufficient in most cases</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12370]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>FFP.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12371]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Factor </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>XI \u2013 concentrate; risk of thrombosis</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> in factor</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> XI inhibitors. </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12372]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>r</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>x</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>IIa \u2013</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>can be used</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> in inhibitors of XI </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12373]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>r</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>x</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>IIa use is</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> off</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>license</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>, can be used carefully in low doses.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12374]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ANC</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>,</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> intrapartum and </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>post-partum</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> care:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12375]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>factor XI or Tranexamic acid is not required antenatally unless an invasive procedure is undertaken or if there is bleeding following miscarriage or surgical procedure.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12376]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Delivery plan individualized</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12377]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Prophylactic factor XI replacement in homozygous or compound heterozygous, previous history of bleeding.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12378]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Central </strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Neura</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>xial</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong> Anesthesia:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12379]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Don\u2019t in women with low f \u2013 XI with bleeding phenotype.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12380]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Phenotype is not clear.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12381]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Severe reduction in levels otherwise can be given.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12382]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12383]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12384]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12385]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12386]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12387]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12388]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12389]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12390]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12391]\">\u00a0</p>",
